{
  "name": "Day 19 — Self-Hosted n8n + Uptime Monitor",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Day 19: Self-Hosted n8n + Uptime Monitor\n\n\n**Setup:**\n- Connect: Telegram bot token (BotFather se)\n- URL mein apna domain daalo\n- Best practice: yeh monitor kisi DOOSRE n8n / server par chalao (same server down hua to alert kaun bhejega?)\n\nCourse: Day 19 lesson page",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "8de2cf89-fe25-433c-a527-05d3d00e2ed2",
      "name": "Setup Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 5
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "190ead35-336d-4d49-ae40-89d336737439",
      "name": "Every 5 Minutes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://n8n.yourdomain.com/healthz",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 10000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true,
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "c7b3dc62-0588-43db-a328-9f7a67861a94",
      "name": "Ping n8n",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        260,
        300
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "bb1da67f-71cf-4392-ac2a-e8a698fdad38",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.statusCode }}",
              "rightValue": 200,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "notEquals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2ab46724-31cc-4325-a967-034b3d7022a4",
      "name": "Down?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        520,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID",
        "text": "=🔴 n8n DOWN!\nStatus: {{ $json.statusCode || 'no response' }}\nTime: {{ $now.toFormat('HH:mm') }}",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "4b7738b6-aaf1-4167-a2db-4f61b027c55a",
      "name": "Down Alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        780,
        300
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Every 5 Minutes": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Ping n8n",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Ping n8n": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Down?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Down?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Down Alert",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
